==English==


===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[back]] [[door]]}}

# A [[subsidiary]] [[entrance]] to a [[building]] or [[house]] at its rear, normally away from the [[street]].
# A [[secret]] means of [[access]] to something.
# {{slang}} The [[anus]], generally used in reference to anal sex.

